AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Move the declared width from 120 to 100 and reflow the repo[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]flip[dim] · [dim][/dim]after unify[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]flip: change the single width authority and the package.json mirror from[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]120 to 100, reflow every prettier-owned Markdown file, regenerate the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]derived memory shims, agent instruction files, and generated skill [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sources, and update the doc prose that names 120 explicitly.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Move the chezmoi repo and the editor formatter to 100[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]chezmoi[dim] · [dim][/dim]after flip[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi: move the chezmoi repo's own prettier recipes and the nvim [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]conform prettier args from 120 to 100, reflow chezmoi's Markdown, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]redeploy the generated skills so the skills sase writes at 100 pass [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi's own formatting gate.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-gt","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-gt.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9aff1b1326550567cc71e583fbd0ff0a","started_at":"2026-08-07T08:38:36.920034","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1786109511,"sha":"57a045cfc6a7f72308d71d0ec66fb1b39f9af13f","subject":"refactor: narrow the declared prose width from 120 to 100 and reflow"}],"dismissed_at":"2026-08-07T09:35:42.130829","files":{"chat":{"digest":"48ec3c7defc9d6c554d05e8cc88dc54fe7655f6efb475501c0f5ff5428176afc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gt.2/chat.md","size_bytes":6764},"commits":{"digest":"77654670b1db1eaea149d646b8d0a42900cc4c3